Behavioral Self-Rewarding (BSR)
https://github.com/yiranwu0/behavioral-self-rewarding

BSR authors: Yiran Wu, Andrew Zhao, Yurui Chang, Qingyun Wu, Xuan Feng.

This distribution includes and modifies code from rLLM / the Agentica
Project and follows the DeepSWE training recipe. BSR adds behavioral
pairwise judging, task-local reward refinement, and training integration.
The Python namespace remains rllm for compatibility with this codebase.

Bundled dependencies include R2E-Gym and veRL, and the vllm_patch directory
contains modified vLLM source. Their original copyright notices and
Apache License 2.0 terms are retained. Additional third-party notices,
including the MIT-licensed pyext2 helper, are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

